<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="10">
<name>Body &amp; Electrical</name>
<section id="1002T_S000D" variety="S000D">
<name>Other Electrical</name>
<ttl id="1002T_S000D_742B1_T003C" variety="T003C">
<name>ETC System</name>
<para id="X394000010E00PD" category="D" type-id="3001C" name-id="73261-00" from="200612" to="200912">
<name>Customer Problem Analysis Check Sheet</name>
<subpara id="X394000010E00PD_z0" proc-id="RM0550J___0000B5L00000">
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<step1>
<ptxt>Customer Problem Analysis Check Sheet</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E100562" width="7.106578999in" height="8.799559038in"/>
</figure>
</step1>
<step1>
<ptxt>How to Fill In</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E105062" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten4>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>In the ETC system, toll payment is made by wireless communication. Therefore, it is necessary to conduct a thorough customer problem analysis regarding the installation condition of the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly on the vehicle and the vehicle environment at that time.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>To find out the frequency of the problem, ask the customer how often they use ETC.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Fill in each item in the entry fields by referring to the following.</ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>ETC On-board Unit Field</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COLSPEC2" colwidth="2.50in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="4.58in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Check Method (Reference)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Part No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ETC Diagnosis Check (Diagnosis Mode 1) - Model (On-board Unit Part Number) Notification Mode (<xref label="Seep06" href="RM000000BY200NX"/>)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Model registration number</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ETC Diagnosis Check (Diagnosis Mode 1) - Model Registration Number Notification Mode (<xref label="Seep05" href="RM000000BY200NX"/>)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Serial No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Shown on the label of the toll collection (ETC) computer assembly itself (see illustration)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>ETC On-board Unit Management Number</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>ETC Registration Information - On-board Unit Management Number (<xref label="Seep03" href="RM0000021TU001X"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>ETC Diagnosis Check (Diagnosis Mode 1) - On-board Unit Management Number Notification Mode (<xref label="Seep04" href="RM000000BY200NX"/>)</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Software Ver.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ETC Diagnosis Check (Diagnosis Mode 1) - Software Version Notification Mode (<xref label="Seep02" href="RM000000BY200NX"/>)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>DTC 1 Entry Field</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COLSPEC2" colwidth="2.50in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="4.58in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Check Method (Reference)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Time, Error Code, Date</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ETC Diagnosis Check (Diagnosis Mode 1) - Error Log Notification Mode (<xref label="Seep08" href="RM000000BY200NX"/>)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
<table pgwide="1">
<title>DTC 2 (Communication Error Notification) Entry Field</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COLSPEC2" colwidth="2.50in"/>
<colspec colname="COLSPEC1" colwidth="4.58in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Check Method (Reference)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Date, Time, Communication Result, Communication Location, (Vehicle Speed)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>ETC Diagnosis Check (Diagnosis Mode 2) - Communication Log Notification Mode (<xref label="Seep09" href="RM000000BY200NX"/>)</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</item>
</list1>
</atten4>
</step1>
</content5>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
</tmc-service-inc>